<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soymeal export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 65,400 MT were 69 percent less than the previous week and 32 percent below the 4-week average.</p>
<p>The principal buyers were Venezuela (18,100 MT), Turkey (17,700 MT), Algeria (14,300 MT), and Egypt (14,200 MT). Exports of 109,500 MT were off 34 percent from the previous week and 42 percent from the 4-week average.  Venezuela (23,400 MT), Turkey (21,100 MT), Japan (16,400 MT), and Algeria (15,000 MT) were the major recipients.</p>
</text>
